                                <span
                                    style="background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; color: var(--c-cyan); font-size: 0.85rem; border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);">SOT-MRAM</span>
                                <span
                                    style="background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.15); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; color: var(--c-purple); font-size: 0.85rem; border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);">Lógica
